  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-asian-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-asian-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-asian-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>2126-1</td><td>Afghan</td></tr><tr><td>2030-5</td><td>Bangladeshi</td></tr><tr><td>2032-1</td><td>Burmese</td></tr><tr><td>2033-9</td><td>Cambodian</td></tr><tr><td>2034-7</td><td>Chinese</td></tr><tr><td>2036-2</td><td>Filipino</td></tr><tr><td>2037-0</td><td>Hmong</td></tr><tr><td>2029-7</td><td>Indian</td></tr><tr><td>2038-8</td><td>Indonesian</td></tr><tr><td>2039-6</td><td>Japanese</td></tr><tr><td>2040-4</td><td>Korean</td></tr><tr><td>2041-2</td><td>Lao</td></tr><tr><td>2050-3</td><td>Nepalese</td></tr><tr><td>2044-6</td><td>Pakistani</td></tr><tr><td>2045-3</td><td>Sri Lankan</td></tr><tr><td>2046-1</td><td>Thai</td></tr><tr><td>2047-9</td><td>Vietnamese</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
